* Behavioural parts for the audio study schematics. Not vendor models.
* Open-drain comparator: output is pulled to vee (about 50 ohm) while inp < inn.
.subckt CMP_OD inp inn vcc vee out params: offs=0
Rp inp vee 1e12
Rn inn vee 1e12
Rv vcc vee 1e6
B1 out vee I = v(out,vee)/50 * 0.5*(1+tanh(4000*(v(inn)-v(inp)+{offs})))
.ends

* Omron G6K-2F-Y 3 V relay, one pole. 91 ohm coil; worst-case catalog pick-up 26.4 mA,
* release 3.3 mA; 3 ms mechanical delay each way. Coil inductance is an estimate.
.subckt RELAY_G6K_3V cp cn com no params: lcoil=0.2
Rc cp c1 91
Lc c1 c2 {lcoil}
Vs c2 cn 0
Bi ic 0 V = i(Vs)
Ri ic 0 1k
S1 st 0 ic 0 coilsw
.model coilsw sw(vt=14.85m vh=11.55m ron=1 roff=1e9)
Vst s5 0 1
Rst s5 st 1k
Bstn stn 0 V = 1 - v(st)
Td stn 0 dly 0 z0=1k td=3m
Rtd dly 0 1k
S2 com no dly 0 contact
.model contact sw(vt=0.5 vh=0.1 ron=0.1 roff=1e9)
.ends
